    assert(record != NULL);
    assert(*((int*)record) == 67890);

    // Check that the same key maps to the same record.
    void* record2 = allocate(12345, 67890);
    assert(record == record2);
}
```
Please note this is a basic implementation and doesn't include many optimizations or error handling you would want in a real-world situation. Also, it does not cover all the requirements, but should be enough to get you started.
