["Here is a simple implementation of what you are asking for in C. This implementation doesn't take into account performance optimization but rather focuses on the task's requirements.

```c
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <pthread.h>

typedef struct {
    uint32_t rnti;
} RX_UE_INFORMATION_TAG;

